rbo_int8_convrot:\nhttps://huggingface.co/Winnougan/Z-Image-Base-Turbo-INT8-Convrot/tree/main\n\nqwen_3_4b_int8_convrot:\nhttps://huggingface.co/Winnougan/Z-Image-Base-Turbo-INT8-Convrot/tree/main\n\nae-turbo:\nhttps://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo/tree/main/vae"},"color":"#2a363b","bgcolor":"#3f5159"},{"id":98,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-300,230],"size":[270,560],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note","properties":{},"widgets_values":["### Important\nThe Style & Prompt Encoder (\"Positive\") node already contains advanced built-in prompt presets. If you choose to use one of these presets, it might change some aspects of the chosen Wildcard, keep that in mind.\n\n### Keyword Wildcard Processor\nWildcard is a reusable text placeholder that randomly inserts one entry from a predefined list, adding variety and reducing prompt repetition.\n\nTo use a Wildcard, create a .txt file inside the wildcards folder of the Impact Pack (custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack/wildcards). Each line in the file represents a different prompt entry.\n\nLeave the Wildcard field empty and write the prompt normally if you don't want to use Wildcards.\n\nFor more info about this custom_node: https://github.com/VictorDmAlves/comfyui-keyword-wildcard-processor\n\n### Tips\n\nTo generate different Wildcard combinations, keep Batch Size = 1 and increase the Batch Count/Queue Count instead. Each new execution re-rolls the Wildcards, while Batch Size usually reuses the same resolved prompt for every image in the batch.\n\n### Resolution\n* Portrait (896x1152)\n* Square (1024x1024)\n* Landscape (1216x832)"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### Important\nThe Style & Prompt Encoder (\"Positive\") node already contains advanced built-in prompt presets. If you choose to use one of these presets, it might change some aspects of the chosen Wildcard, keep that in mind.\n\n### Keyword Wildcard Processor\nWildcard is a reusable text placeholder that randomly inserts one entry from a predefined list, adding variety and reducing prompt repetition.\n\nTo use a Wildcard, create a .txt file inside the wildcards folder of the Impact Pack (custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack/wildcards). Each line in the file represents a different prompt entry.\n\nLeave the Wildcard field empty and write the prompt normally if you don't want to use Wildcards.\n\nFor more info about this custom_node: https://github.com/VictorDmAlves/comfyui-keyword-wildcard-processor\n\n### Tips\n\nTo generate different Wildcard combinations, keep Batch Size = 1 and increase the Batch Count/Queue Count instead. Each new execution re-rolls the Wildcards, while Batch Size usually reuses the same resolved prompt for every image in the batch.\n\n### Resolution\n* Portrait (896x1152)\n* Square (1024x1024)\n* Landscape (1216x832)"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[280,3,0,130,0,"VAE"],[281,130,0,140,0,"VAE"],[282,140,0,28,1,"VAE"],[290,144,0,145,2,"CONDITIONING"],[291,145,0,28,0,"LATENT"],[309,152,0,153,0,"MODEL"],[310,153,0,145,1,"MODEL"],[311,139,0,154,0,"LATENT"],[313,154,0,156,0,"LATENT"],[314,156,0,145,0,"LATENT"],[315,5,0,152,0,"MODEL"],[318,5,1,158,0,"CLIP"],[319,158,0,159,0,"CLIP"],[320,159,0,144,0,"CLIP"],[322,160,0,144,4,"STRING"],[324,28,0,163,0,"IMAGE"],[325,164,0,5,1,"CLIP"],[326,165,0,5,0,"MODEL"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.569047619047619,"offset":[730,265.09623430962347]},"frontendVersion":"1.17.11","workflowRendererVersion":"LG","node_versions":{"comfy-core":"0.3.13","rgthree-comfy":"5d771b8b56a343c24a26e8cea1f0c87c3d58102f","ComfyUI-Detail-Daemon":"90e703d3d3f979438471c646a5d030840a2caac3","ComfyUI-GGUF":"5875c52f59baca3a9372d68c43a3775e21846fe0","ComfyUI_essentials":"33ff89fd354d8ec3ab6affb605a79a931b445d99"}},"version":0.4}